    "short_description": "Inlight is a digital product agency and IT consulting firm located in Clifton Hill, Victoria, Australia. Founded in 2008, the company focuses on creating digital products that enhance business operations through a blend of product strategy, design, user experience, and software development. With a team of 51\u2013200 professionals, Inlight specializes in web development, application development, mobile development, and digital strategy.\n\nThe agency offers a range of services, including web and application development using React and React Native, mobile app creation, and digital strategy and UX/UI design. Inlight also provides ecommerce solutions and API integrations, ensuring compatibility across systems. The company is dedicated to managing full-cycle product development with an emphasis on delivery excellence and exceptional client experiences.",
